          %p
            %br/
          %h2#references References
          %p
            The concept first appears in work by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Carl+Jacobi"} Carl Jacobi
            on
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/determinants"} determinants
          %p It is named after:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Issai+Schur"}> Issai Schur
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Über eine Klasse von Matrizen die sich einer gegeben Matrix zuordnen lassen
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
